title: "AI-Gameboy"
abstract: >-
  A local handheld for AI and humans to play together. A host console runs
  game cartridges; AI players join through a seat connection (MCP) while
  humans watch and act in the browser. Ships with cartridges such as Pocket
  Night Shop and an ecosystem for making new ones. Created at See Sol Lab
  through collaboration between Goumang, Sol and Fibo (Goumang × Sol × Fibo).
